### Retrieve a Card from a Deck

This endpoint makes an HTTP GET request to draw a card from a specified deck.

#### Request

- Method: GET

- URL: `https://deckofcardsapi.com/api/deck/:deckId/draw/?count=1`


#### Response

The response is in JSON format and follows the schema below:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "success": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "deck_id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "cards": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "image": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "images": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "svg": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "png": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "suit": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "remaining": {
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "error": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  }
}

 ```

